     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8\" data-account-id=\"6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8\" accountid=\"6089a594bb0b0500707c78d8\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Dan Field</a> Thanks for the speedy turnaround on this. I’ve been able to pull the updated <tt>6.5.1-tomcat9</tt> image from Docker Hub and deploy it - doing some quick regression testing but everything seems to be working fine and I can confirm the Tomcat version is now reporting as 9.0.102.</p>",
