  "description": "<p>Thanks to <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=60e6dea128780700684084e6\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"60e6dea128780700684084e6\" data-account-id=\"60e6dea128780700684084e6\" accountid=\"60e6dea128780700684084e6\" rel=\"noreferrer\">John Gostick</a> for bringing this CRITICAL RCE to our attention. </p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2025-24813\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://cve.mitre.org/cgi-bin/cvename.cgi?name=CVE-2025-24813</a> </p>\n\n<p>We’re targeting <tt>tomcat:9-jdk11-temurin</tt> so a refresh of the docker build should incorporate the patch from upstream which is now 9.0.102 which includes the fix <a href=\"https://github.com/docker-library/tomcat/blob/4ef8521605121c14062319c9b8688fa4de044ba0/9.0/jdk11/temurin-noble/Dockerfile#L19\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/docker-library/tomcat/blob/4ef8521605121c14062319c9b8688fa4de044ba0/9.0/jdk11/temurin-noble/Dockerfile#L19</a> </p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo-exts/fcrepo-docker/blob/dcea4bf3539d116da568f9e3e84edffa12b319f3/Dockerfile#L1\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo-exts/fcrepo-docker/blob/dcea4bf3539d116da568f9e3e84edffa12b319f3/Dockerfile#L1</a> </p>",
